\aleph_\alpha^{\aleph_\beta} = \mu.$$ [3mProof.[0m Each $\aleph_\alpha^{\aleph_\beta} = \aleph_{\gamma(\alpha,\beta)} < \mu$ (hypothesis), so the sup is $\leq \mu$.
